#: Welcome+to+OpenEmu%21
msgid "Welcome to OpenEmu!"
msgstr "Welcome to OpenEmu!"

#: An+exciting+world+of+video+games+is+within+your+grasp.+To+help+you+get+started,+we%E2%80%99d+like+to+ask+you+a+few+quick+questions+which+will+guide+you+through+the+following%E2%80%A6%5Cn%5Cn%E2%80%A2+Ensure+you+are+running+the+correct+system+plugins+(cores).
msgid ""
"An exciting world of video games is within your grasp. To help you get "
"started, we’d like to ask you a few quick questions which will guide you "
"through the following…\n"
"\n"
"• Ensure you are running the correct system plugins (cores)."
msgstr ""
"An exciting world of video games is within your grasp. To help you get "
"started, we’d like to ask you a few quick questions which will guide you "
"through the following…\n"
"\n"
"• Ensure you are running the correct system plugins (cores)."

#: Click+on+the+%E2%80%98Next%E2%80%99+button+to+begin%21
msgid "Click on the ‘Next’ button to begin!"
msgstr "Click on the ‘Next’ button to begin!"

#: OpenEmu+is+modular,+and+thanks+to+the+work+of+other+great+open+source+projects,+it+can+emulate+a+wide+variety+of+video+game+systems+(%E2%80%98cores%E2%80%99).+A+select+few+require+you+tick+and+confirm+that+you+want+to+install+and+use+them.+Your+favorite+game+systems+and+games+may+not+run+without+these+cores.
msgid ""
"OpenEmu is modular, and thanks to the work of other great open source "
"projects, it can emulate a wide variety of video game systems (‘cores’). A "
"select few require you tick and confirm that you want to install and use "
"them. Your favorite game systems and games may not run without these cores."
msgstr ""
"OpenEmu is modular, and thanks to the work of other great open source "
"projects, it can emulate a wide variety of video game systems (‘cores’). A "
"select few require you tick and confirm that you want to install and use "
"them. Your favorite game systems and games may not run without these cores."

#: System+Cores+Installation
msgid "System Cores Installation"
msgstr "System Cores Installation"

#: Let%E2%80%99s+Go%21
msgid "Let’s Go!"
msgstr "Let’s Go!"

#: Great%21+You+are+all+setup+now+and+ready+to+get+gaming%21%5Cn%5CnRemember+you+can+change+both+your+keyboard+and+gamepad+controls+for+yourself+and+other+players+via+the+Preferences+at+any+time.
msgid ""
"Great! You are all setup now and ready to get gaming!\n"
"\n"
"Remember you can change both your keyboard and gamepad controls for yourself "
"and other players via the Preferences at any time."
msgstr ""
"Great! You are all setup now and ready to get gaming!\n"
"\n"
"Remember you can change both your keyboard and gamepad controls for yourself "
"and other players via the Preferences at any time."

